    visitDesc: { en: "We believe in transparency. Our main headquarters and processing facility are located right at our flagship farm in Musanze. Come visit us during our weekend farm tours!", rw: "Twizerera mu gukorera mu mucyo. Ibiro byacu biri ku murima wacu wa Musanze. Turakarandura!", fr: "Nous croyons en la transparence. Venez nous rendre visite lors de nos visites de ferme du week-end!", sw: "Tunaamini uwazi. Makao makuu yetu yako shambani kuu letu mjini Musanze." },
